{"seq":3,"slug":"large-file-download-streaming","title":"大文件下载与流式响应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-file-upload-streaming/streaming-processing/large-file-download-streaming","wordCount":1177,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"大文件下载与流式响应\">大文件下载与流式响应</h1><p>上传是将字节从客户端搬运到服务端，下载则是反向——但绝非简单的反转。大文件下载面临独特的工程挑战：如何在不加载整个文件到内存的前提下支持 Range 请求、如何在网络波动时保持连接不超时、如何利用 HTTP 协议特性实现断点续下和并行下载。本篇从服务端视角深入讨论流式响应的实现细节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Range 请求</strong>：HTTP 标准的部分内容获取机制，客户端指定字节范围，服务端返回 206 Partial Content</li>\n<li><strong>sendfile</strong>：OS 级零拷贝系统调用，数据在内核态从文件直接传输到 socket，不经过用户空间</li>\n<li><strong>chunked 编码</strong>：当内容长度未知时，使用 Transfer-Encoding: chunked 边生成边发送</li>\n<li><strong>流式 ZIP</strong>：利用 ZIP 格式 Central Directory 位于末尾的特性，实时生成 ZIP 流而非预打包</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"http-range-请求\">HTTP Range 请求</h2><p>Range 请求是大文件下载的基石。客户端通过 <code>Range</code> 头指定需要的字节范围，服务端返回 <code>206 Partial Content</code> 和对应数据段。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"http\" data-code=\"# 客户端请求第 1MB 到第 2MB 的数据&#10;GET /files/large-video.mp4 HTTP/1.1&#10;Range: bytes=1048576-2097151&#10;&#10;# 服务端响应&#10;HTTP/1.1 206 Partial Content&#10;Content-Range: bytes 1048576-2097151/1073741824&#10;Content-Length: 1048576&#10;Accept-Ranges: bytes&#10;&#10;&lt;1MB binary data&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 客户端请求第 1MB 到第 2MB 的数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>GET /files/large-video.mp4 HTTP/1.1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Range: bytes=1048576-2097151</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 服务端响应</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>HTTP/1.1 206 Partial Content</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Content-Range: bytes 1048576-2097151/1073741824</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Content-Length: 1048576</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Accept-Ranges: bytes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;1MB binary data></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"服务端实现-range-支持\">服务端实现 Range 支持</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { createReadStream, statSync } from &#39;node:fs&#39;;&#10;import { IncomingMessage, ServerResponse } from &#39;node:http&#39;;&#10;&#10;function handleRangeRequest(req: IncomingMessage, res: ServerResponse, filePath: string) {&#10;  const stat = statSync(filePath);&#10;  const fileSize = stat.size;&#10;  const range = req.headers.range;&#10;&#10;  if (!range) {&#10;    // 无 Range 头：返回完整文件&#10;    res.writeHead(200, {&#10;      &#39;Content-Length&#39;: fileSize,&#10;      &#39;Content-Type&#39;: &#39;application/octet-stream&#39;,&#10;      &#39;Accept-Ranges&#39;: &#39;bytes&#39;,&#10;    });&#10;    createReadStream(filePath).pipe(res);&#10;    return;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const [startStr, endStr] = range.replace(&#39;bytes=&#39;, &#39;&#39;).split(&#39;-&#39;);&#10;  const start = parseInt(startStr, 10);&#10;  const end = endStr ? parseInt(endStr, 10) : fileSize - 1;&#10;  const chunkSize = end - start + 1;&#10;&#10;  res.writeHead(206, {&#10;    &#39;Content-Range&#39;: `bytes ${start}-${end}/${fileSize}`,&#10;    &#39;Content-Length&#39;: chunkSize,&#10;    &#39;Content-Type&#39;: &#39;application/octet-stream&#39;,&#10;    &#39;Accept-Ranges&#39;: &#39;bytes&#39;,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  createReadStream(filePath, { start, end }).pipe(res);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createReadStream, statSync } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'node:fs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { IncomingMessage, ServerResponse } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'node:http'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handleRangeRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IncomingMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">res</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ServerResponse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">filePath</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> stat</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> statSync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(filePath);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fileSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stat.size;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> req.headers.range;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">range) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 无 Range 头：返回完整文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    res.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">writeHead</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'Content-Length'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: fileSize,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'Content-Type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'application/octet-stream'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'Accept-Ranges'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bytes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    createReadStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(filePath).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pipe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(res);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">startStr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">endStr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> range.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">replace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bytes='</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">split</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'-'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parseInt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(startStr, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> end</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> endStr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parseInt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(endStr, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fileSize </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> chunkSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> end </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  res.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">writeHead</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">206</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'Content-Range'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`bytes ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">start</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}-${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">end</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}/${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">fileSize</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'Content-Length'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: chunkSize,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'Content-Type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'application/octet-stream'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'Accept-Ranges'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bytes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  createReadStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(filePath, { start, end }).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pipe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(res);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"range-请求的多段支持\">Range 请求的多段支持</h3><p>HTTP 规范允许单次请求多个不连续范围（<code>Range: bytes=0-999, 2000-2999</code>），响应使用 <code>multipart/byteranges</code> 格式。但实践中多段 Range 增加了服务端复杂度且收益有限，多数 CDN 和服务器选择只支持单段范围。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>是否建议支持多段 Range</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>视频流媒体</td>\n<td>否，播放器按序请求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PDF 阅读器</td>\n<td>可选，部分阅读器使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>下载管理器并行分段</td>\n<td>否，多连接单段更高效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字节级文件 diff</td>\n<td>是，减少请求数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"流式响应的内存控制\">流式响应的内存控制</h2><h3 id=\"transfer-encoding-chunked\">Transfer-Encoding: chunked</h3><p>当文件大小未知（如动态生成的内容）或需要边生成边发送时，使用 chunked 传输编码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function streamDynamicContent(res: ServerResponse) {&#10;  res.writeHead(200, {&#10;    &#39;Transfer-Encoding&#39;: &#39;chunked&#39;,&#10;    &#39;Content-Type&#39;: &#39;application/octet-stream&#39;,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  const readable = generateDataStream(); // 动态生成&#10;  readable.on(&#39;data&#39;, (chunk) =&gt; {&#10;    res.write(chunk);&#10;  });&#10;  readable.on(&#39;end&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;    res.end();&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> streamDynamicContent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">res</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ServerResponse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  res.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">writeHead</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'Transfer-Encoding'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'chunked'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'Content-Type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'application/octet-stream'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> readable</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generateDataStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 动态生成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  readable.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'data'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">chunk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    res.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">write</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(chunk);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  readable.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'end'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    res.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"content-length-vs-chunked-的权衡\">Content-Length vs Chunked 的权衡</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Content-Length</th>\n<th>Chunked</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>进度显示</td>\n<td>客户端可计算百分比</td>\n<td>无法计算总进度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Range 支持</td>\n<td>完整支持</td>\n<td>不支持（不知道总大小）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连接复用</td>\n<td>明确边界</td>\n<td>需等待终止 chunk</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>静态文件、已知大小</td>\n<td>动态生成、实时处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>生产实践：对于已存储的文件，始终设置 <code>Content-Length</code>；对于实时转码输出使用 chunked。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从对象存储流式下载\">从对象存储流式下载</h2><p>直接从 S3/GCS 获取文件并流式转发给客户端，中间服务器不缓存完整文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func proxyDownload(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request, bucket, key string) {&#10;    input := &amp;s3.GetObjectInput{&#10;        Bucket: aws.String(bucket),&#10;        Key:    aws.String(key),&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 透传客户端的 Range 头&#10;    if rangeHeader := r.Header.Get(&quot;Range&quot;); rangeHeader != &quot;&quot; {&#10;        input.Range = aws.String(rangeHeader)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    result, err := s3Client.GetObject(r.Context(), input)&#10;    if err != nil {&#10;        http.Error(w, &quot;not found&quot;, http.StatusNotFound)&#10;        return&#10;    }&#10;    defer result.Body.Close()&#10;&#10;    // 设置响应头&#10;    if result.ContentRange != nil {&#10;        w.Header().Set(&quot;Content-Range&quot;, *result.ContentRange)&#10;        w.WriteHeader(http.StatusPartialContent)&#10;    } else {&#10;        w.Header().Set(&quot;Content-Length&quot;, strconv.FormatInt(*result.ContentLength, 10))&#10;    }&#10;    w.Header().Set(&quot;Content-Type&quot;, *result.ContentType)&#10;&#10;    // 流式转发，内存占用 = buffer size&#10;    io.Copy(w, result.Body)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> proxyDownload</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">w</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ResponseWriter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">bucket</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    input </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">s3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GetObjectInput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Bucket: aws.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bucket),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Key:    aws.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 透传客户端的 Range 头</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rangeHeader </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.Header.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Range\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); rangeHeader </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        input.Range </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aws.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rangeHeader)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s3Client.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GetObject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), input)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        http.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"not found\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, http.StatusNotFound)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    defer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result.Body.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 设置响应头</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result.ContentRange </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        w.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Content-Range\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result.ContentRange)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        w.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WriteHeader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(http.StatusPartialContent)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        w.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Content-Length\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, strconv.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">FormatInt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result.ContentLength, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    w.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Content-Type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result.ContentType)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 流式转发，内存占用 = buffer size</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    io.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Copy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w, result.Body)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"断点续下的实现\">断点续下的实现</h2><p>客户端下载中断后，通过记录已下载的字节偏移量实现续下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 客户端&#10;    participant S as 服务端&#10;&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: GET /file (首次请求)&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;C: 200 OK, Content-Length: 1GB, ETag: &quot;abc123&quot;&#10;    Note over C: 下载到 500MB 时网络中断&#10;&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: GET /file, Range: bytes=524288000-&#10;    Note over C: If-Range: &quot;abc123&quot; (确认文件未变)&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;C: 206 Partial Content (剩余 500MB)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 客户端\n    participant S as 服务端\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: GET /file (首次请求)\n    S--&gt;&gt;C: 200 OK, Content-Length: 1GB, ETag: \"abc123\"\n    Note over C: 下载到 500MB 时网络中断\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: GET /file, Range: bytes=524288000-\n    Note over C: If-Range: \"abc123\" (确认文件未变)\n    S--&gt;&gt;C: 206 Partial Content (剩余 500MB)</pre><p><code>If-Range</code> 头的作用是确保文件在两次请求间未被修改。如果 ETag 不匹配，服务端返回 <code>200</code> 和完整文件，客户端需要从头下载。</p>\n<h2 id=\"大文件下载的性能优化\">大文件下载的性能优化</h2><h3 id=\"sendfile-系统调用\">sendfile 系统调用</h3><p>对于静态文件，绕过用户空间直接在内核中从文件描述符拷贝到 socket：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// Go net/http 在 Linux 上自动使用 sendfile&#10;http.ServeFile(w, r, &quot;/data/large-file.bin&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Go net/http 在 Linux 上自动使用 sendfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">http.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ServeFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w, r, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/data/large-file.bin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>sendfile 的优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>零拷贝：数据不经过用户空间 buffer</li>\n<li>减少上下文切换：一次 syscall 完成</li>\n<li>内核级 DMA 优化</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"预读取与缓冲调优\">预读取与缓冲调优</h3><p>Linux 内核的 readahead 机制对顺序读取做预读优化。对于随机 Range 请求，可通过 <code>posix_fadvise</code> 提示内核：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"posix_fadvise(fd, offset, length, POSIX_FADV_SEQUENTIAL); // 顺序读&#10;posix_fadvise(fd, 0, 0, POSIX_FADV_DONTNEED);            // 释放页缓存\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">posix_fadvise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fd, offset, length, POSIX_FADV_SEQUENTIAL);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 顺序读</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">posix_fadvise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fd, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, POSIX_FADV_DONTNEED);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            // 释放页缓存</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"响应压缩的取舍\">响应压缩的取舍</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文件类型</th>\n<th>是否压缩</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HTML/JSON/CSS</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>文本压缩率高（60-80%）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已压缩文件（ZIP/GZIP）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>二次压缩浪费 CPU 无收益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图片（JPEG/WebP）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>已是压缩格式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视频（MP4/MKV）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>压缩率极低且破坏 Range</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对于不应压缩的大文件，确保 Nginx/CDN 配置排除这些 MIME 类型的 gzip。</p>\n<h2 id=\"流式-zip-打包下载\">流式 ZIP 打包下载</h2><p>多文件批量下载时，服务端实时生成 ZIP 流（不预先打包整个 ZIP）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import archiver from &#39;archiver&#39;;&#10;&#10;function streamZipDownload(res: ServerResponse, files: FileInfo[]) {&#10;  res.writeHead(200, {&#10;    &#39;Content-Type&#39;: &#39;application/zip&#39;,&#10;    &#39;Content-Disposition&#39;: &#39;attachment; filename=&quot;download.zip&quot;&#39;,&#10;    &#39;Transfer-Encoding&#39;: &#39;chunked&#39;,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  const archive = archiver(&#39;zip&#39;, { zlib: { level: 1 } }); // level 1 平衡速度&#10;  archive.pipe(res);&#10;&#10;  for (const file of files) {&#10;    const stream = getFileStream(file.path);&#10;    archive.append(stream, { name: file.name });&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  archive.finalize();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> archiver </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'archiver'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> streamZipDownload</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">res</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ServerResponse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">files</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FileInfo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  res.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">writeHead</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'Content-Type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'application/zip'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'Content-Disposition'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'attachment; filename=\"download.zip\"'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'Transfer-Encoding'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'chunked'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> archive</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> archiver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'zip'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { zlib: { level: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } }); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// level 1 平衡速度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  archive.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pipe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(res);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> file</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> files) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> stream</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getFileStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(file.path);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    archive.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(stream, { name: file.name });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  archive.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">finalize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>ZIP 格式的 Central Directory 位于文件末尾，使得流式生成成为可能——每个文件条目按序写入 Local Header + Data + Data Descriptor，最后写入 Central Directory。</p>\n<h2 id=\"客户端断连检测\">客户端断连检测</h2><p>服务端在写入大文件响应时必须检测客户端是否已断开，避免继续执行无意义的 I/O：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { pipeline } from &#39;node:stream/promises&#39;;&#10;&#10;async function handleDownload(req: IncomingMessage, res: ServerResponse) {&#10;  if (req.destroyed) return; // 防御：请求已断&#10;&#10;  try {&#10;    await pipeline(&#10;      createReadStream(filePath),&#10;      res, // pipeline 自动检测 res 关闭&#10;    );&#10;  } catch (err: any) {&#10;    if (err.code === &#39;ERR_STREAM_PREMATURE_CLOSE&#39;) {&#10;      // 客户端主动断开，正常清理即可&#10;      return;&#10;    }&#10;    throw err;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { pipeline } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'node:stream/promises'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handleDownload</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IncomingMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">res</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ServerResponse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (req.destroyed) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 防御：请求已断</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pipeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      createReadStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(filePath),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      res, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// pipeline 自动检测 res 关闭</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">err</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (err.code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ERR_STREAM_PREMATURE_CLOSE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 客户端主动断开，正常清理即可</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    throw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关于如何从监控维度追踪下载失败率和中断原因，参见 <a href=\"../security-reliability/upload-observability-debugging\">上传可观测性与问题排查</a>。关于 CDN 层面的下载加速策略，参见 <a href=\"../storage-integration/cdn-origin-optimization\">CDN 回源与分发优化</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>大文件下载的工程核心是「不缓冲整个文件」——通过 Range 请求支持断点续下、sendfile 实现零拷贝、chunked 编码支撑动态生成内容、流式 ZIP 实现批量打包下载。服务端必须检测客户端断连以避免资源泄漏，对于静态文件应优先利用 OS 级 sendfile 优化，对于不同 MIME 类型需要差异化的压缩决策。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大文件下载与流式响应","id":"大文件下载与流式响应"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"HTTP Range 请求","id":"http-range-请求"},{"level":3,"text":"服务端实现 Range 支持","id":"服务端实现-range-支持"},{"level":3,"text":"Range 请求的多段支持","id":"range-请求的多段支持"},{"level":2,"text":"流式响应的内存控制","id":"流式响应的内存控制"},{"level":3,"text":"Transfer-Encoding: chunked","id":"transfer-encoding-chunked"},{"level":3,"text":"Content-Length vs Chunked 的权衡","id":"content-length-vs-chunked-的权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"从对象存储流式下载","id":"从对象存储流式下载"},{"level":2,"text":"断点续下的实现","id":"断点续下的实现"},{"level":2,"text":"大文件下载的性能优化","id":"大文件下载的性能优化"},{"level":3,"text":"sendfile 系统调用","id":"sendfile-系统调用"},{"level":3,"text":"预读取与缓冲调优","id":"预读取与缓冲调优"},{"level":3,"text":"响应压缩的取舍","id":"响应压缩的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"流式 ZIP 打包下载","id":"流式-zip-打包下载"},{"level":2,"text":"客户端断连检测","id":"客户端断连检测"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"文件转换管道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-file-upload-streaming/streaming-processing/file-transformation-pipeline"},"next":{"title":"对象存储集成（S3/GCS/OSS）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-file-upload-streaming/storage-integration/object-storage-s3-gcs"}}